  "title": "Metallic flake car paint with a flip colour",
  "purpose": "Build a car paint node material: a two-tone colour that flips at grazing angles, Voronoi metal flakes that tilt the base layer's normal so they sparkle, and a smooth clear coat on its own normal. Use it for vehicles, product renders and toys.",
